      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "34",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Moonghajeega ng'eanyiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ajeaksiinda fuga Israeli ak giyeeshi, Iyoahiti jeeda ng'eanyiida Ganaani, (nih ng'eanyiida jea ghoabineegwa ak goohearanyi, aba gideaba ng'eanyiini giduurji moonghajeagaaschi), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea meatkweedeang'wa duukusa wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara gayghang'eada dareapcheeda Sini ak gwasik murdeeda Edomu, nea moonghoodeang'wa aba wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara ghang'eada muudeanooda Basooda Balang'da ak ghoadoas; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghaghwan geaw moonghoodeang'wa gagal wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara gal naweeda Akrabimu ak gwasik Sini, ea ghwahita Gadesh-barneya, aba wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara; ng'ata gaygawa ea ghwahita Hasar-adari, ak gawa ea ghwahita Asmoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata ghaghwan geaw moonghooda aba Asmoni ea ghwahita ghealooda Misri, ak gabursa Basooda haw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea aba heeda biyeara moonghooda gajea Basooda hawi ea heeda neekeewa; nih gayghoah moonghoodeang'wa aba heeda biyeara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak moonghoodeang'wa bea wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa nih gil, ghang'eada Basooda haw gajang'waara moonghoodeang'wa ea ghwahita Giijeeda Hori; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghang'eada giijeeda Hori gajang'waara moonghooda ea ghwahita seawadeeda Hamati, ak muudeanooda moonghooda gajea Sedada; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghang'ata moonghooda ea ghwahita Sifroni, ak muudeanoadaanyi gajea Hasarenani; nih gayghoah moonghoodeang'wa aba wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gajang'waara moonghoodeang'wa bea heeda ghayeawa ghang'eada Hasarenani ea ghwahita Shefamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghwararang'aada moonghooda ghang'eada Shefamu ea ghwahita Ribla mida gayeewda Ayini; ng'ata gayghwararang'aada moonghooda ea ghwahita murdeeda basooda Ginereti aba heeda ghayeawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghwararang'aada moonghooda ea ghwahita Yordani, ak gamuudean aba Basooda Balang'da. Nih ng'eanyiideang'wa aba gidabeada moonghajeagaaschi iisineaweesa meadajeega sean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarukusa Musa fuga Israeli, nea gwayeesha, “Nih ng'eanyiida jea ahearanana ng'alealeeda, ghayi ayi NG'UTAMIIDA gajeataw fugeaba eemoojigiga ashageashiin, ea fuga mwaatkwa bea eamwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba fuga eemeeda Rubeni ea gealga ghweaniga nyaawa, ea fuga eemeeda orjooga Gadi aba gealga gheanyaawa, ghayi saawa ninyas, sea fuga mwaatkwa bea eemeeda Manase ninyas haleanjeeda nyaawa hearan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eemoojisu asiyeenyean ea fuga mwaatkwa bea eamwa ninyas haleanjeeda nyaawa hearan aba meatkweeda niirja bea Yordani, aba hoowa bea Yerikohiin, aba meatkweeda ghayeawa, arearuuna aseeta.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga hees bea lachooda ng'eanyiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabalool NG'UTAMIIDA sea Musa, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Suh gheawunga fuga jea alakiisiina ng'eanyiida jea gwahearani gil ghoah deang'wa, Eliyasari was ashoohoocheanda sea Yoshuwa orjeeda Nuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajageani siyagi haw aba giliwas eamwa, ak ghwalajaada ng'eanyiida ghoah heechea ahearana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gheawunga fiisu ea suh; aba eemeeda Yuda, gajea Galebu gil orjeeda Yefune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba eemeeda orjooga Simeoni, Shemueli orjeeda Amihudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba eemeeda Benjamini, ea Elidadi orjeeda Gisloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba eemeeda orjooga Dani, aahaw Buki was orjeeda Yogoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba orjooga Yosefu; aba eemeeda orjooga Manase, aahaw Hanieli was orjeeda Efodi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak aba eemeeda orjooga Efraimu, aahaw Gemueli was orjeeda Shiftani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba eemeeda orjooga Sabuloni, aahaw Elisafani was orjeeda Barnaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba eemeeda orjooga Isakari, aahaw Baltieli was orjeeda Asani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba eemeeda orjooga Asheri, aahaw Abihudi was orjeeda Shelomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba eemeeda orjooga Naftali, aahaw Bedaheli was orjeeda Amihudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba alakiisiina hearaniischooda fuga Israeli aba ng'eanyiida Ganaani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
